-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore;&quot;&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style=&quot;font: 7.0pt &#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Biblii Anania&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt; = 19 buc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: .5in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore;&quot;&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style=&quot;font: 7.0pt &#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Biblia Sinodală grena dimensiunea 0.73&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt; &amp;ndash; 21 buc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: .5in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore;&quot;&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style=&quot;font: 7.0pt &#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Bibia Sinodală grena dimensiunea 0.53&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt; &amp;ndash; 43 buc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: .5in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore;&quot;&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style=&quot;font: 7.0pt &#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Mica Biblie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt; &amp;ndash; 20 buc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: .5in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore;&quot;&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style=&quot;font: 7.0pt &#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Noul Testament cu Psalmi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt; &amp;ndash; 6 buc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 35.45pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Asociația Ortodoxia Tinerilor, cod fiscal 30116644, cu adresa &amp;icirc;n str. Frunzei nr.5, bl. F3, sc.2, ap. 63, Galați, jud. Galați, reprezentată de domnul Claudiu Balan &amp;icirc;n calitate de președinte, donează aceste biblii Asociației Kinonia, cod fiscal&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;30745970, cu adresa &amp;icirc;n str. Frații Buzești nr. 14-15, Slatina, jud. Olt, reprezentată de domnul Vărzaru Mădălin, &amp;icirc;n calitate de președinte.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 35.45pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;Standard&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 35.45pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;RO&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: RO;&quot;&gt;Asociația Kinonia va dona la r&amp;acirc;ndul ei aceste biblii tinerilor și copiilor din activitățile pe care le desfășoară &amp;icirc;n județul Olt &amp;icirc;mpreună cu Episcopia Slatinei și Romaniților.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','',''),(11,'','0000-00-00','0000-00-00','','',''),(12,'','0000-00-00','0000-00-00','','',''),(13,'Excursie la mare pentru copiii din plasament din jud. Olt (2-6 sept. 2025)','2025-09-02','2025-09-06','<p>Excursia a avut loc la Eforie Sud la Vila Sunny.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Am plătit cazarea <strong>11.100 de lei&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Au participat:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>20 de copii trimiși de Direcția Generală de Asistență și Protecția Copilului Olt</li>\r\n<li>5 doamne &icirc;nsoțitoare venite din jud. Olt</li>\r\n<li>5 voluntari care au ajutat la desfășurarea excursiei (Claudiu Balan, Liviu B&acirc;rsan, Dan Dănilă, Oana Moldoveanu și Ștefania Dovleac)</li>\r\n<li>la care s-au mai adăugat &icirc;n ultimele 2-3 zile și alți membri OT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>M&acirc;ncarea am cumpărat-o și gătit-o singuri cu ajutorul bucătarului nostru Liviu B&acirc;rsan.&nbsp;Avem bonuri de m&acirc;ncare cumpărată de Liviu de la Brașov, apoi din Constanța și din Eforie Sud.</p>\r\n<p>bonuri de șezlong (4 șezlonguri zilnic pentru 30 de persoane), bonuri de la toaleta publică, etc.</p>\r\n<p>Am făcut cu ei o excursie la Constanța la Delfinariu și pe faleză.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>am plătit 1600 de lei transportul pentru un autocar mare</li>\r\n<li>am plătit 896 de lei intrarea la Delfinariu din Constanța</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Am avut 2 mese cu pizza comandată din Eforie Sud:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>bon 720 de lei</li>\r\n<li>bon 600 de lei</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Am plătit biletele de tren celor 5 doamne pe ruata Slatina - Eforie Sud. Copiii au avut gratuit pe tren.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>265 x 5 = 1325 lei</li>\r\n</ul>','https://ortodoxiatinerilor.ro/excursie-la-mare-la-eforie-sud-pentru-copiii-din-familiile-defavorizate-din-jud-olt-2-6-sept-2025/','');
